PROJECT REPORT
Amazon Product Availability Checker – Project Report
1. Introduction
The Amazon Product Availability Checker is an automation tool developed in Python to help users monitor the availability of products on Amazon. Instead of manually checking the product page repeatedly, this script automatically checks the product’s stock status and alerts the user via email when the product becomes available.


2. Objectives
To automate Amazon product availability tracking

To provide real-time notification to users through email

To reduce manual effort and save time

To create a lightweight, easy-to-use monitoring tool


3. System Architecture
The system works as follows:

User Input: The user provides an Amazon product URL

Periodic Fetching: The script fetches the product webpage using HTTP requests

HTML Parsing: Using BeautifulSoup, it extracts the availability status

Condition Check: If the product is found “In Stock”

Alert System: An email notification is sent to the user

Loop: The process repeats in a defined time interval


